## Goal
Flag invalid member access on nested Nod/Collection types when the member is known absent.

## Source
todo-cover-cases-next.txt — Case 5 (2026-04-20, tm-editor-plus-plus)

## Repro
```angelscript
auto map = GetApp().RootMap;
string collName = string(map.Collection.CollectionName);
```

## Compiler (game-side)
`Editor/Map.as (506, 48) : ERR : 'CollectionName' is not a member of 'CGameCtnCollection'`

## Reality
Name lives on `CGameCtnChallenge` (`map.CollectionName`), not on nested `CGameCtnCollection`.

## Workaround
`string collName = string(map.CollectionName);`

## LSP today
0 diagnostics. Nadeo types intentionally suppress UndefinedMember via `is_nadeo_type` because member metadata is incomplete.

## Acceptance
- [ ] Strategy chosen: improve Nadeo member completeness and/or selectively enable UndefinedMember when property lists are trusted
- [ ] `CGameCtnCollection.CollectionName` diagnosed when type DB lacks the member
- [ ] Does not flood false UndefinedMember on incomplete Nadeo types
- [ ] Regression test for this chain

## Notes
Blocked more by typedb completeness policy than by a missing if-statement.